@startuml
title Lab 2 用户系统调用的陷入与返回
hide footbox
participant "用户程序\nU 态" as User
participant "RISC-V 硬件" as CPU
participant "uservec / userret\n课程 trampoline.S" as Tramp
participant "usertrap / usertrapret\n内核 trap.c" as Trap
participant "syscall.c\n系统调用分发" as Sys

User -> CPU : ecall；a7 为调用号，a0 至 a2 为参数
CPU -> CPU : sepc = ecall 地址；scause = 8
CPU -> Tramp : 记录特权状态，转入 S 态并跳转 stvec
activate Tramp
Tramp -> Tramp : sscratch 暂存用户 a0；31 个寄存器写入 trapframe
Tramp -> Tramp : 换内核 sp 与 satp；sfence.vma
Tramp -> Trap : 调用 usertrap
deactivate Tramp
activate Trap
Trap -> Trap : stvec = kernelvec；保存 sepc；epc += 4
Trap -> Sys : 根据 trapframe.a7 分发
activate Sys
Sys --> Trap : 返回值写入 trapframe.a0；未知调用返回 -1
deactivate Sys
Trap -> Trap : 关闭中断；stvec = uservec；准备 sepc 与 sstatus
Trap -> Tramp : 跳转 userret，传入用户页表 satp
deactivate Trap
activate Tramp
Tramp -> Tramp : 换用户 satp；恢复通用寄存器与 a0
Tramp -> CPU : sret
deactivate Tramp
CPU -> User : 以 U 态从 ecall 后一条指令继续执行
@enduml
